| `scripts/jobs/declare_no_app.py` | Declares `layers.app` `null` when the update brings a composition root the project deleted. | runs under `copier update` | [`layers.app`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Acts only when the path is absent and the old manifest had no `layers.app`. Escaping writes exit 2; mutations use the confined resolved path. | [generate-and-upgrade.md](../guides/generate-and-upgrade.md) | always |
